1
00:00:00,644 --> 00:00:02,524
(Leonard:)Starting Saturday morning,
"Star Wars" marathon.

2
00:00:02,688 --> 00:00:04,778
- Woo-hoo.
- Movies or video games?

3
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:06,860
Or board games? Or trading-card games?

4
00:00:07,026 --> 00:00:09,356
Or Legos? Or dress-up? Or comic books?

5
00:00:09,528 --> 00:00:11,318
(Sheldon:)Or dramatic readings of novelizations?

6
00:00:11,489 --> 00:00:13,489
(Sheldon:)Yes to all.

7
00:00:15,117 --> 00:00:17,537
(Leonard:)We are going to play the online game.

8
00:00:17,703 --> 00:00:20,663
(Sheldon:)The online game? Bully.

9
00:00:21,624 --> 00:00:23,624
(Amy:)As much as I'm sure Sheldon would enjoy...

10
00:00:23,793 --> 00:00:26,633
(Amy:)...playing intergalactic make-believe,
he and I have plans.

11
00:00:26,796 --> 00:00:29,756
(Amy:)We are attending my Aunt Flora's
93rd birthday party.

12
00:00:30,257 --> 00:00:32,097
(Sheldon:)Just tell her I can't come.

13
00:00:32,551 --> 00:00:34,471
(Amy:)She'll be disappointed if we don't show.

14
00:00:34,637 --> 00:00:37,517
(Sheldon:)She's 93.
She won't be disappointed for very long.

15
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:41,810
(Amy:)Hang on. I followed all the protocols...

16
00:00:41,977 --> 00:00:44,437
(Amy:)...set forth by you
in the Relationship Agreement.

17
00:00:44,605 --> 00:00:47,775
l made a written request
72 hours in advance.

18
00:00:48,526 --> 00:00:50,736
Checked the tire pressure on the car.

19
00:00:50,903 --> 00:00:52,903
l contacted the
Centers for Disease Control...

20
00:00:53,072 --> 00:00:56,412
(Amy:)...to find out what shots they
recommend for travel to Orange County.

21
00:00:57,827 --> 00:01:00,157
FYl, it's none.

22
00:01:00,746 --> 00:01:02,416
(Sheldon:)Amy, the Relationship Agreement...

23
00:01:02,581 --> 00:01:05,251
(Sheldon:)...was not designed
for either one of us to get our way.

24
00:01:05,918 --> 00:01:07,248
(Amy:)You use it to get your way.

25
00:01:07,419 --> 00:01:09,419
l use it to get the right way.

26
00:01:10,965 --> 00:01:14,305
(Sheldon:)The fact that the right way
is also my way is a happy coincidence.

27
00:01:16,053 --> 00:01:18,553
(Amy:)You gave me your word.
You're coming with me.

28
00:01:18,722 --> 00:01:19,892
(Leonard:)We'll miss you, Sheldon.

29
00:01:20,057 --> 00:01:22,517
Yeah? Well, who wants
to spend the whole weekend...

30
00:01:22,685 --> 00:01:26,105
(Sheldon:)...running around a bunch of pretend
planets battling made-up monsters?

31
00:01:26,272 --> 00:01:30,152
(Sheldon:)- That's for babies.
- Yeah, but it's got lightsabers.

32
00:01:30,317 --> 00:01:35,027
Yeah. Please, Amy, it's got lightsabers.

